+# Vendored third-party code
+
+| File | Source | Version | SHA-256 |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `noble-post-quantum-0.7.1-ml-dsa.mjs` | `https://esm.sh/@noble/post-quantum@0.7.1/es2022/ml-dsa.bundle.mjs` (single-file ESM bundle of [`@noble/post-quantum`](https://github.com/paulmillr/noble-post-quantum), MIT) | 0.7.1 | `2a94c77dc60e2322e421671fa0761d3292349a1bc55f1271f0302c1f7b7060b2` |
+
+It's served from our own origin so the page needs no third-party script at
+runtime and the Content-Security-Policy can stay at `script-src 'self'`.
+To upgrade, download the new bundle, check it against the npm release, run
+`npm test`, and update the hash above.
